5&#x02013;29, &#x02a7e;30 years), recent body mass index (in quintiles) and recent alcohol consumption (no intake, &#x0003c;5, 5&#x0003c;&#x02212;10, &#x0003e;10&#x02009;g&#x02009;day<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>).</p></fn><fn id="t1-fn2"><label>b</label><p><italic>P</italic> for Wald <italic>&#x003c7;</italic><sup>2</sup>, test of linear effect using the original continuous variable.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>